{"id":"4db97b7c5bd611b9","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-double-indexing.md","title":"Fibration over a fibration","display":"df-double-indexing — Fibration over a fibration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-double-indexing","aliases":["16-df-double-indexing","Fibration over a fibration"],"display":"df-double-indexing — Fibration over a fibration","depends_on":["[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-fibre]]","[[16-thm-composite-fibration]]"],"source":"Proposition 9.4.3 p.550 (PDF 570); explicit composite lifting calculation","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-double-indexing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-double-indexing</span><span>Fibration over a fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-double-indexing — Fibration over a fibration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e3e5877d95b23f0\" href=\"?note=2e3e5877d95b23f0\" title=\"16-thm-composite-fibration\">16-thm-composite-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 9.4.3 p.550 (PDF 570); explicit composite lifting calculation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=p\\circ q\">\\(r=p\\circ q\\)</span>。纤维化谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p,\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q,\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p,\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q,\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a>；纤维使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\)</span> 在本页定义，为固定基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 上的纤维化之上的纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 作为从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的函子。对象纤维必须区分 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_I^r=r^{-1}(I)\">\\(\\mathcal D_I^r=r^{-1}(I)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_X^q=q^{-1}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal D_X^q=q^{-1}(X)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_I\">\\(\\theta_I\\)</span> 是下文给出的带标记不交并双射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r(f)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(qf)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r(f)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(qf)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(f)\\land\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(qf)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\Longrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(f)\\land\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(qf)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_I:\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_I^r\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\coprod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I^p}\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_X^q,\n\\qquad\\theta_I(Y)\\coloneqq(qY,Y),\\qquad\\theta_I^{-1}(X,Y)\\coloneqq Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_I:\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_I^r\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\coprod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I^p}\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_X^q,\n\\qquad\\theta_I(Y)\\coloneqq(qY,Y),\\qquad\\theta_I^{-1}(X,Y)\\coloneqq Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Proposition9.4.3 p.550（PDF570）。原书从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:r\\to p\">\\(q:r\\to p\\)</span> 已是固定基底上的纤维化态射出发，等价刻画 q 本身为纤维化；此处把相应前提和笛卡尔保持条件显式放入谓词。本页采用忘却 cleavage 后的存在性版本；若要得到原书的 cloven 结构，应进一步固定 p、q 的提升选择，并以连续提升诱导 r 的选择。没有把未选提升的谓词误说成已指定的结构。</p>\n<p>若 q-笛卡尔 f 的 q 像又是 p-笛卡尔，先按 p 分解再按 q 分解即给 r-笛卡尔性。反向先以 p-笛卡尔及 q-笛卡尔的连续提升构造同一基箭头、同一靶的标准 r-提升；任意 r-笛卡尔 f 与它相差一个 r-垂直同构。q 及 p 都保持同构，因此 f 本身 q-笛卡尔且 qf 为 p-笛卡尔。于是任意两条可复合纤维化均满足本页谓词，复合存在见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e3e5877d95b23f0\" href=\"?note=2e3e5877d95b23f0\" title=\"16-thm-composite-fibration\">16-thm-composite-fibration</a>。</p>\n<p>末式只分解对象集合：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rY=I\">\\(rY=I\\)</span> 恰当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(qY)=I\">\\(p(qY)=I\\)</span>，逆映射丢弃唯一确定的标签。它没有声称复合纤维范畴是各内部纤维的范畴余积。旧文件脱离上一显示公式的合取以及不区分 q/r 的纤维记号均已修复。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-composite-fibrati