","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p,\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q,\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_I^r=r^{-1}(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_X^q=q^{-1}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(r)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r(f)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(qf)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{Fib}(q)\\Longrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal D)\n\\bigl[\\mathrm{Cartesian}_r(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(f)\\land\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(qf)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta_I:\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_I^r\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\n\\coprod_{X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I^p}\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_X^q,\n\\qquad\\theta_I(Y)\\coloneqq(qY,Y),\\qquad\\theta_I^{-1}(X,Y)\\coloneqq Y.","display":true},{"tex":"q:r\\to p","display":false},{"tex":"rY=I","display":false},{"tex":"p(qY)=I","display":false}],"bytes":3114,"backlinks":[{"id":"ea8d9d804dd09634","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibOver}$ (规范双重索引谓词, see [[16-df-double-indexing]])"},{"id":"40bbce3cf6eb26b0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p,q$ 是函子；$\\mathrm{FibOver}(q,p)$ 采用 [[16-df-double-indexing]]，$\\mathrm{FibOver}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 由本页 Assertion 定义。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-double-indexing|df-double-indexing — Fibration over a fibration]]"}],"outgoing":["427be4d627513590","c9801f31ec8ac53f","aa1ce0bab1ae8910","2e3e5877d95b23f0"]}